# webOS TV deploy (XPlay Lite)

After any fix under `src/` (or build/scripts that affect the packaged app), **always produce a fresh installable IPK** before finishing the task.

## Build (Node 20)

```bash
source ~/.nvm/nvm.sh && nvm use 20 && npm run package
```

Confirm output exists:

```bash
ls build/com.xplay.lite_*.ipk
```

Do **not** install from `dist/*.ipk` — use the `build/` artifact from `npm run package`.

## Install on device

```bash
ares-install --device Alec-TV build/com.xplay.lite_0.1.0_all.ipk
```

(Adjust version segment if `package.json` version changes; glob `build/com.xplay.lite_*.ipk` to find the current file.)

## When to skip

Skip only for changes that cannot affect the TV bundle (e.g. docs-only, tests-only with no `src/` changes). If in doubt, run `npm run package`.
